.SH NAME
lean-config - View or initialize lean.toml configuration


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean config [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage project-level lean.toml configuration.

.PP
Examples:
  lean config                  # show current config
  lean config init             # write a default lean.toml
  lean config set --default-profile development
  lean config set --secrets-backend gpg --secrets-recipient you@example.com


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for config


